<title>BELGIUM: Belgolux Jan-Dec 1996 trade surplus narrows.</title>
<headline>Belgolux Jan-Dec 1996 trade surplus narrows.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Statistics Office released the following provisional data on trade in the Belgo-Luxembourg Economic Union (in billions of francs) -</p>
<p>    BELGOLUX TRADE		   Dec 96    Nov 96    Dec 1995</p>
<p>    Exports			    404.6     440.4     378.5</p>
<p>    Imports			    380.2     386.7     361.3</p>
<p>    Balance			     24.4	63.7	17.3</p>
<p>					Jan-Dec 96	    Jan-Dec 95</p>
<p>    Exports (cumulative)	 5,204.5		 5,016.4</p>
<p>    Imports (cumulative)	 4,795.7		 4,580.8</p>
<p>    Balance			    408.8		   435.5</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
